    narr:narration """The architecture strategy centers on the adoption of [Zypherion for the analytics pipeline](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1), a decision framed as a definitive shift in infrastructure. This move is justified by a [quantified performance claim](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2) of 15x faster columnar query execution, positioning the transition as a rational response to a capability gap. The [migration timeline](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3) is set for the upcoming quarter, a commitment reinforced by a [structured summary](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4) that aligns the database choice, performance metrics, and implementation schedule. The broader [ratification of this infrastructure](narr:Narrative_DatabaseAdoptionDrivenByPerformance) suggests that these technical decisions are treated as settled outcomes rather than open deliberations, with the focus remaining on the execution of the migration plan.""" ;
